-- Fallen master (ex44): hop then structural removal, left-join-null on the dangling mentor. Twin of 44-fallen-master.bqn.
-- Japanese surface: 師匠が死んだ北は、訓練を失う。 Entity 1 dangles (mentor -1) and fails the predicate, so it keeps Trained: the expect's second value pins the .bqn's dangling-hop assertion. -Trained clears the presence mask, modeled as the bool column itself.
--! registry 44-fallen-master
